/* ==================== Script 117 ==================== */
/* ===== Editor step 9: preview speed =====
   While paused, many edits (slider drags, scrubbing) each asked for a full render and they piled up.
   Now at most one render runs and one more is queued, always using the newest state. Playback and
   export still render every frame in order. Frame times are kept in window.__amiyoPerf. */
