/* ===== Editor step 10: draft preview while playing =====
   Quality: Auto switches to a lighter preview when playback frames get slow (over ~45 ms) and back
   when they recover. Draft skips sharpen and film grain, refreshes scopes less often, keys chroma at
   lower resolution and blits with cheaper smoothing. Saved projects and exports are never affected. */
