/* =========================================================================
   Editor step 7 (of 10): Captions panel and caption styles
   Before: the Captions tab was one sentence and one button; captions were
   single-line text that ran off the screen when long. Now: a list of every
   caption (jump to it, edit the words, delete), add / import SRT & VTT /
   export SRT, paste a script and have it timed for you, nine caption styles
   with live preview tiles (classic, boxed, outline, word-highlight, neon,
   bar, marker, minimal, brand), position and size controls, automatic line
   wrapping, and a soft pop-in. Every change is one undo step.
   ========================================================================= */
